<title>UK: UBS sets warrants on LIFFE German Bund future.</title>
<headline>UBS sets warrants on LIFFE German Bund future.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Bank of Switzerland said it has issued one million American-style call and put warrants, in four equal tranches, on December 1996 LIFFE German Bund Future.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 06.SEP.96-22.NOV.96   PAYDATE	06.SEP.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   NONE			MIN EXER LOT 10000</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  96.50 PCT</p>
<p>* * * * * * * * *</p>
<p> WARRANT	  STRIKE     PRICE     PREMIUM	GEARING</p>
<p> CALL	     89.0 PCT   6.07 CHF  0.0 PCT	12.83 X</p>
<p> CALL	     91.0 PCT   4.45 PCT  0.01 PCT     17.45 X</p>
<p> PUT		104.0 PCT  6.07 CHF  0.0 PCT	12.83 X</p>
<p> PUT		102.0 PCT  4.45 CHF  0.01 PCT     17.45 X</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
